# local secret — GitHub token, never commit
github_token_*.txt

# local-only review notes — keep off GitHub (provenance kept locally)
data-raw/copilot_taxonomy_review_*.md
data-raw/taxonomy_audit.csv

# local-only code_reporter audit output — private, keep off GitHub
code_reporter/

# local-only working record of MalAvi data problems. NEVER publish this.
# It holds the raw downstream reports and the verification behind them. The
# curated, public-facing version of this information is the list printed by
# malavi_issues() in R/malavi_issues.R, and that list is the only version that
# should ever reach GitHub, the built package, or the website.
DATA_ISSUES.md

# Local-only working notes, kept out of git deliberately.
# LINEAGE_QC_LENGTH_GATE.md says so in its own first line: it names a withdrawn
# submission, an intake directory carrying a submitter's name, and two reserved
# lineage names that are not public. The others use release data only but were
# never chosen for publication. Listed here because they sit in data-raw/ beside
# tracked files, so a `git add -A` on that directory would sweep them into a
# commit -- which is exactly how they reached the public remote once. Add paths
# explicitly when committing in data-raw/.
data-raw/CHIMERA_SCREEN_SPECIFICITY.md
data-raw/LINEAGE_QC_LENGTH_GATE.md
data-raw/TAXONOMY_CROSSWALK_GAPS.md
data-raw/chimera_leave_one_out.R
data-raw/chimera_leave_one_out_results.txt
